+ * nord2_mdp_api.h -- 0671: the MDP blit service between bsd/dev/nord2_mdp.inc (C, owns the hardware) and
+ * iokit/Kernel/arm/sweet_m2scaler.inc (0672, C++, AppleM2ScalerCSCDriver + /dev/redwood-mdp surface blits).
